        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Cold Corner 2\n- People: Lloyd Banks, 50 Cent, Tony Yayo\n- Organizations: G-Unit\n\nFacts:\n- Lloyd Banks was born as Christopher Charles Lloyd on April 30, 1982.\n- Lloyd Banks is an American hip hop recording artist.\n- Lloyd Banks is a member of the East Coast hip hop group G-Unit.\n- Lloyd Banks is in G-Unit alongside his childhood friends 50 Cent and Tony Yayo.\n- The Cold Corner 2 is the eleventh mixtape by American rapper Lloyd Banks.\n- The Cold Corner 2 was released for free download on November 8, 2011.",
